    "market_commentary": "The SSY Pacific Capesize Index jumped 1,799 points week-on-week to the highest level since October 2021 at 11,136. There was a $1.90/t increase in the W.Australia-China iron ore spot voyage rate to $15.10/t, while the round -voyage rate climbed by $10,000/day to $37,750/day.",
